# Black Stride ship tilemap (prototype)
# Legend: '.'=empty/space  '#'=hull wall (exterior)  'W'=interior wall  'F'=floor  'D'=door  'G'=hull window/glass (solid, translucent)  'J'=floor window/glass (solid, translucent)  'H'=helm/control station (walkable; crew mans it to pilot)  'A'=hull door / airlock (solid; the docking port two ships mate through)
# Roof footprint in global mode = every non-empty tile.
tile_size 32
size 11 17
grid
...#GGG#...
..#FJJJF#..
..#FFHFF#..
.#WWWDWWW#.
.#FFFFFFF#.
#FFWFFFWFF#
#FFDFFFWFF#
AFFWFFFDFFA
#FFWFFFWFF#
#FFWFFFWFF#
.#FFFFFFF#.
.#WWWDWWW#.
.#FFFFFFF#.
..#WFFFW#..
..#WFFFW#..
..#FFFFF#..
...#####...
end
